id: og_nightmarket_b
name: Night Market II
description: Night Market. A covered market street where every route is twelve metres long, the stock rooms behind the stalls are the only quiet places, and one walkway above sees the length of it. Built as a covered night market; it was cleared at closing and the awnings were left up.

